  "aboutNameStoryTitle": "How we got the name",
  "aboutNameStoryQuote": "“Call it Zaytona — like my doll.”",
  "aboutNameStoryBody": "The app was called “Zaytona”, and the name never quite fit. Aljawharah had been turning options over for days, her little sister Alhanouf quietly listening on the call.\n\nThen Alhanouf looked up at the small doll on her shelf and said, with a child’s certainty: “Call it Zaytona.” Aljawharah laughed — then stopped. The name wouldn’t leave her.\n\nThe next day she pitched it to the team, holding her breath. They loved it instantly. From one little doll on an ordinary call, Zaytona was born — and became a family.",
